B.Ts=new A.aJ(B.fw,["Cheerish","Cheerish is an interactive educational quiz and MCQ platform designed for school students from Grades 1 to 12. The app helps students strengthen their academic foundation through chapter-wise practice tests and comprehensive performance analytics.\n\nFeatures of Cheerish App:\n\nSeamless Student Access: Students log in effortlessly using their mobile number via OTP verification.\n\nCustomized Learning Path: Select grade (1st to 12th standard), choose subjects, and explore chapter-wise quiz modules and mock tests.\n\nInstant Results & Ranking: Get immediate test evaluation with detailed breakdown of correct vs. wrong answers, solution explanations, and test ranks.\n\nDedicated Parent Portal: Separate login for parents using email ID to track attendance, monitor subject & chapter-wise marks, view rank history, and review overall progress.","assets/images/cheerish/cheerish.jpg",B.bx,B.q,B.Ov,null,null,null,"2024","Freelancer","Mobile App"],t.R)
